{"id": "tea:bhaktamal:1", "source": "src:bhaktamal", "location": {"ref": "opening dohā"}, "paraphrase": "Devotee, devotion, the Lord and the guru — four names, one body; bowing to their feet destroys every obstacle.", "tags": {"level": "bridging", "standpoint": "devotional", "naya": null, "path": ["devotion"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["ultimate", "teacher-transmission"], "original": {"text": "भक्त भक्ति भगवंत गुरु चतुर नाम बपु एक । इनके पद बंदन किए नासत बिघ्न अनेक ॥", "script": "Devanāgarī", "edition": "recalled from memory; to be checked against a printed edition", "licence": "public domain (pre-1900 text)"}, "teachers": ["tch:nabhadas"], "concepts": ["cpt:four-in-one-bhaktamal", "cpt:cari-vastu"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "ai_translated": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U26-regional-bhakti"], "disagreements": []}, "coverage": ["A9"], "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "high", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U26-regional-bhakti"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:bhaktamal:mira", "source": "src:bhaktamal", "location": {"ref": "chappay on Mīrā"}, "paraphrase": "Mīrā showed in the Kali age a love like the gopīs'; fearless, she sang the Lord's glory; the wicked plotted her death, yet not a hair was harmed and she drank the poison like nectar; beating the drum of devotion and ashamed before none, she cast off public shame and the chains of family and worshipped Giridhar.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "devotional", "naya": null, "path": ["devotion"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["ethics"], "teachers": ["tch:nabhadas", "tch:mirabai"], "obstacles": ["obs:loka-lajja"], "concepts": ["cpt:krsna-as-husband"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "ai_translated": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U26-regional-bhakti"], "disagreements": []}, "coverage": ["A9"], "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U26-regional-bhakti"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:bhaktamal:ramananda", "source": "src:bhaktamal", "location": {"ref": "chappay on Rāmānanda (c. no. 36; numbering varies)"}, "paraphrase": "Rāmānanda, like Raghunātha, built a second bridge by which the world crosses over; his disciples were Anantānanda, Kabīr, Sukhānanda, Surasurānanda, Padmāvatī, Naraharī, Pīpā, Bhāvānanda, Raidās, Dhanā, Sena and Surasurī (Surasurānanda's wife).", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "seeker", "naya": null, "path": ["devotion"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["teacher-transmission"], "teachers": ["tch:nabhadas", "tch:ramananda", "tch:kabir", "tch:ravidas", "tch:pipa", "tch:sena", "tch:dhanna"], "disputes": ["dsp:women-caste-liberation"], "concepts": ["cpt:bhakti-and-caste"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "ai_translated": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U26-regional-bhakti"], "disagreements": []}, "coverage": ["A9"], "notes": "Order and exact names follow memory of the chappay; verify.", "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U26-regional-bhakti"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:bhaktamal:tulsi", "source": "src:bhaktamal", "location": {"ref": "chappay on Tulsīdās"}, "paraphrase": "For the deliverance of the crooked beings of the Kali age Vālmīki was born again as Tulsī; the Rāmāyaṇa of a hundred crore verses, one syllable of which destroys the greatest sin, he made easy for all.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "devotional", "naya": null, "path": ["devotion"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["teacher-transmission"], "teachers": ["tch:nabhadas", "tch:tulsidas"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "ai_translated": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U26-regional-bhakti"], "disagreements": []}, "coverage": ["A9"], "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U26-regional-bhakti"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
